       "text": "Nabq"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000004d",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " transformó Taba en un importante destino turístico."
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000004e",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000004f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "En la actualidad, la ciudad cuenta "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000051",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000050"
       ],
       "text": "con más de diez hoteles"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000052",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " y varios complejos turísticos, que satisfacen las diversas necesidades de turistas y visitantes."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000053",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000054",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "La rica "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000056",
